WEBVTT

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.480
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:55.530
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.150
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:07.530
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.530
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:14.480
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:19.030
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:22.780
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:25.400
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:31.150
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.690
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.480
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.690
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:43.730
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:46.690
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:49.360
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:53.940
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.030
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.020
"Chapter 8"
"A Promise"

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.940
Man, talk about sudden.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.980
His Majesty's a real slave driver, ordering us
to come back without so much as a reason.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.150
How generous.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.320
What are you grumbling about?

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.030
Talking to yourself?

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.900
Oh, Knight Commander.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.530
Thank you for meeting me.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:51.110
Are you concerned for me?

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.360
I'm more concerned

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.070
that you do the right thing down below.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.650
So, first a trade agreement.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.190
And then...

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.530
Don't be reckless.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:12.360
What did I tell you?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.030
It'll work out.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.730
You did say that.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.110
Now,

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:31.400
one last goodbye to the Queen of Light.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.690
Yes.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:48.230
So much... They're awfully generous.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.440
I'll be a little lonely,

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.690
but I can't let His Highness
spend any more time with her,

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:02.280
so this may have worked out perfectly.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.030
Excuse us.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.820
Hey.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.480
Here.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.690
Yes, Majesty.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:08.610
We wish for a trade agreement.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.530
Please deliver this message to your king.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.280
As you wish.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:16.150
This will make a fine souvenir.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:18.030
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.690
Didn't you say yourself

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.570
that if we both wish for balance,

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.480
our kingdoms are the same?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:31.570
And if we can make a new treaty, I'm sure...

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.530
I must take my leave of Your Majesty.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:47.280
Yes, I've entrusted you with a letter.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:51.070
No, this is the end.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:54.820
Balance is the law of this world.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.690
It is true that all life should be protected.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.690
But only by those with strength to spare.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:07.110
To those without, it's an alien rule
fluttering above their heads.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.730
Mr. Envoy?

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.530
It must be fine for the people of White.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:18.400
They're promised lives of plenty thanks to
abundant Soul and the Progenitor Rune.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.780
But we who crawl on the ground are different.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.190
This floating continent hangs over us.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:28.030
Why are we forever in its shadow?

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:32.150
To maintain the balance between
earth and sky, darkness and light.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.030
That has been the way of things
since the world began.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.820
That's why we're not the same.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:45.820
"The way of things" is just

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:49.320
a convenient spell for the strong!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.360
Adel?

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.400
Is this a joke?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:58.530
Thank you for your sympathy.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.440
But I don't need it!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.530
Try saying that once you've fallen to earth!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.360
Your Majesty!

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.440
What?!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.030
Black...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.690
Ph-Phious!

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.730
Seize that man!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.780
You barbarian!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.980
You people aren't human!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:02.690
I've seen how your kingdom does things!

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.480
I was a fool for ever

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.360
allowing myself to trust you!

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.230
If that's how you want it,

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:23.070
I'll erase you and the ground you crawl on!

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.860
Bring ropes!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.400
Wait.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.110
Later, I'll take my time

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:38.650
getting you to tell me what you know
about your kingdom.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.530
Wait.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.690
That man is...

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.530
Your Majesty!

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:49.860
Quickly, this way!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.480
A-All right.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.650
I'll have to bring them something
in return on my next visit.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.440
Wh-What?!

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:18.030
It looks like the envoy was arrested!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:18.980
We've got to go!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:20.440
Huh?! What do you mean?!

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.150
I don't know the details!

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:25.110
Then what about the two of them?!

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:28.190
We leave now and see what happens.

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:30.860
S-See what happens?

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:33.440
Like what?

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.320
Damn!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:48.530
Friendship between our kingdoms?

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.440
I was a fool!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.980
Damn! Damn!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.030
Phious...

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:06.400
It's fine, isn't it?

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.980
We were able to prevent the attack.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:11.190
How is it "fine"?!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.820
Phious.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:19.940
Sorry.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:25.440
But... Sheama, Theo, I don't understand anymore.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.360
What don't you understand?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.230
Does balance mean opposition?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:37.280
Are the knights doomed
to fight for all eternity?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.940
If so, is Her Majesty...

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.400
All eternity?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:51.570
You've never experienced that,

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:54.280
so why worry about it?

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.480
Theo?!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:59.190
Who's lived for all eternity?

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:04.400
I fought with the kid next door yesterday,

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:07.190
but that fight won't last forever.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:10.070
If I just kept dragging out our fight,

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.360
you'd get mad at me, wouldn't you?

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.440
Theo.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.820
Can't grown-ups do that?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.110
Aren't grown-ups better at
controlling themselves?

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.400
One day you'll know.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:27.530
I don't want to hear excuses.

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:28.650
Theo!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.860
Phious...

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.860
Maybe Theo...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:47.610
...would be able to make an age
where the fighting doesn't drag on.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:51.030
That's what I thought.

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:55.690
Yes, he's a kind boy.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.030
But...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.780
I...

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.480
We have a duty.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:10.320
We can't afford to waver.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:12.730
I suppose not.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.610
Don't stay up too late.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.030
Good night.

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:28.110
Duty, huh.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.610
My worries

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.780
must be nothing compared to Her Majesty's.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:41.320
I just have to protect her.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.280
To give my all to protect Her Majesty.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:50.070
Black on earth, White in the sky...

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:55.190
Why must fellow preservers
of the balance fight each other?

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:00.530
O Progenitor Rune.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:06.940
If it is the way of this world for
sky and earth to hate each other,

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:10.940
I may not be able to last.

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:18.030
Standing atop all that hatred
is something that I just...!

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:30.530
White Priestess, Queen of Light,

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.320
you must make a decision

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:37.030
about what we must protect.

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.190
What...

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:42.030
...we must protect?

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:49.980
"No. 08 The People of Black"
"Most have more realistic, down-to-earth
outlooks than the people of White,
possibly because they are constantly
exposed to the threat of monster attacks."

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.070
I see.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.320
I was a fool!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:27.900
Then I was brought here.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:33.780
That time...

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:39.110
...why did I protect the Queen of Light?

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:47.780
We came to strengthen friendly ties with White,
so maybe it was natural?

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:55.940
But if Adel got secret orders to kill
the Queen of Light without my knowing...

00:14:55.940 --> 00:15:02.230
...maybe letting him carry them out
would have been better for the Kingdom of Black.

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:05.650
I don't know.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.780
That time...

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.320
...what did I choose?

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:17.570
That time, what was I trying to say?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.480
Black...

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:38.820
Black and its people are the same.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:44.940
We just have no choice but to obey the king.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.730
Don't... think ill of us.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.570
That's not it.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.820
It wasn't an apology.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:58.480
That isn't what I need to tell
the Queen of Light.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:11.480
A white... cat?

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.610
Where did it come from?

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.320
Wh-What the...

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.280
Is it calling me?

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.570
Still...

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.530
There's not a single guard.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.980
Don't tell me

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.690
they're trying to let me get away?

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.980
The queen?!

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:26.280
When we clasp hands like this...

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:30.570
...we can support each other, and yet...

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.650
Light isn't all there is.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:39.400
There's darkness in the world, too.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:43.730
Both of them can give peace.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.280
And yet...

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.070
To protect...

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:03.440
My wish is the same.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:08.610
If it will make everyone
in both our kingdoms happy,

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:13.650
I'll support you, even from down in the mud.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.230
I want you to follow

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.360
that path you believe in.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:34.070
I'm the successor to the King of Darkness.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:37.110
The Prince of Darkness.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:41.150
Yes, I could feel it.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:44.980
I will succeed to the throne.

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:49.230
We'll bring peace to this world together.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:53.480
I promise.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.980
Thank you.

00:20:56.360 --> 00:21:01.610
White is light, Black is darkness...
Sky and earth.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:06.190
Let's support each other
from where we each belong.

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:08.360
It's a promise.

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:11.530
Yes. Until then...

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.530
Of course.

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:24.940
I have to go.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.480
Thank you for all you've done for me.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.730
Don't worry about me.

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:37.030
Please wait until the time comes.

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:40.900
I will.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:44.690
You aren't alone.

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:50.150
Light and darkness are opposite poles.

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:54.480
Never touching, they create balance.

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.650
I will keep...

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:04.440
...my promise to you.

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:21.280
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:24.900
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.360
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:34.690
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:44.150
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:54.360
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:57.900
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:07.400
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:10.190
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:18.610
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:21.940
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:24.780
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.940
"Next Time"
"Chapter 9: The Queen of Light
and the Prince of Darkness"
